95. EXECUTION LIFECYCLE
==================================================

Canonical lifecycle:

CREATED
↓
QUEUED
↓
RUNNING
↓
CHECKPOINT
↓
WAITING / PAUSED
↓
RESUME
↓
RUNNING
↓
