99. FINAL STATEMENT
==================================================

Durable Execution gives PRSL-AI a distinction that is fundamental
to a reliable intelligent ecosystem:

The intelligence may change.

The provider may change.

The device may change.

The network may disappear.

The worker may restart.

The service may fail.

But the logical operation does not have to disappear with them.

PRSL-AI therefore separates:

USER INTENT
from
TASK

TASK
from
EXECUTION

EXECUTION
from
RUNTIME

RUNTIME
from
DEVICE

DEVICE
from
USER IDENTITY

and:

EXECUTION STATE
from
USER MEMORY.

This separation allows the ecosystem to recover, migrate,
pause, resume and verify complex operations without confusing
temporary infrastructure state with permanent user continuity.

The objective is not:

"Keep every process alive forever."

The objective is:

"Preserve enough authoritative state for the ecosystem to safely
continue meaningful work after interruption."


